## Regression coverage

The focused suite proves:

- first durable consume succeeds
- sequential replay returns the stored completed receipt
- two concurrent consumers cause exactly one provider call
- replay by another authenticated user is rejected
- transfer to another browser session is rejected
- transient provider failure moves to `failed_retryable` and the same user can retry
- expired state is rejected before pricing or provider work
- payload and signature tampering are rejected
- changed product, quantity, and country are rejected
- inactive PPP selectors cannot authorize carried country
- trusted Turkey issuance survives login and yields `$89.70`
- current-policy Thailand yields the `$99` alumni price
- US plus forged Turkey query remains US
- valid PPP checkout metadata keeps Turkey restriction and does not consume alumni credit
- the browser bootstrap rejects open redirects and sets the secure cookie
- the lifecycle has no transition out of `completed` or `expired`

